    "# Full MVTec AD benchmark \u2014 PatchCore (WideResNet50, 1% coreset)\n",
    "Runs training-free **PatchCore** across **all 15 MVTec AD categories** on a T4 GPU,\n",
    "loading data from a public Hugging Face mirror. Prints per-category and mean\n",
    "image / pixel AUROC. **Runtime -> T4 GPU**, then **Run all**."
   ]
  },
